{"path":"types/numeric_limits/digits10","title":"std::numeric_limits<T>::digits10","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numeric_limits&lt;T&gt;::</span>digits10","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/digits10","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"The value of std::numeric_limits<T>::digits10 is the number of base-10 digits that can be represented by the type T without change, that is, any number with this many significant decimal digits can be converted to a value of type T and…","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> digits10<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> digits10<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">digits10</span></span></code> is the number of base-10 digits that can be represented by the type <code>T</code> without change, that is, any number with this many significant decimal digits can be converted to a value of type <code>T</code> and back to decimal form, without change due to rounding or overflow. For base-<a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/radix\">radix</a> types, it is the value of <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits/digits\"><code>digits()</code></a> (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">digits <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> for floating-point types) multiplied by <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small \\log_{10}{radix}\">log<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">10</span>(radix)</span> and rounded down.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Standard_specializations\">Standard specializations</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  <code>T</code>\n</td>\n<td>  value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">digits10</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/* non-specialized */</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>  <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">digits</sp